<title>UK: Basler Kantonalbank sets warrants on Tege.</title>
<headline>Basler Kantonalbank sets warrants on Tege.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Basler Kantonalbank said it has issued 625,000 American-style call warrants on shares of Tege SA.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by five warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    200 CHF		   PREMIUM	53.7 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.50 CHF		  GEARING	18 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 01.APR.97-18.MAR.99   PAYDATE	01.APR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWX</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
